@step Preview the import - a dry run saves no rows.
aeat app ledger import --file fixtures/movimientos-2026-1t.csv --provider csv --dry-run
@step Save the rows by repeating the command without --dry-run.
aeat app ledger import --file fixtures/movimientos-2026-1t.csv --provider csv
@step Confirm an imported row is now in the records.
@result aeat --format json app ledger view 21853f4f
@expect result.transaction.description == "Cobro factura limpieza de oficinas enero"
